{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wandered through a massive parking lot and in that moment forget where you've parked? &quot;<i>Where is my Car?&quot;</i> takes that familiar struggle and turns it into a playful 3D maze adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore colorful environments, hunt down your misplaced car, and race against the clock to make it back before your parking time runs out. Collect coins along the way to pay for your ticket \u2014 the more you gather, the more time you\u2019ll have. But don\u2019t get too comfortable: each run is a test of memory, speed, and a little bit of luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its cozy art style and lighthearted gameplay, &quot;<i>Where is my Car?&quot;</i> is easy to jump into, but hard to put down. Whether you\u2019re chasing a new best time or just enjoying the silly charm, it\u2019s a game about turning everyday frustrations into fun challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfce\ufe0f Find your car in maze-like 3D parking areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f Collect coins to add precious seconds to the countdown timer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf Aim for the best time and highest coin count</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f Simple, cozy, and accessible \u2014 perfect for quick sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 Replayable runs with increasing challenge</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4057750?t=1769595492","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4057750?t=1769595492","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057750/33f659376b987dbce5ad55002a57c87687da55eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769595492","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor